    <node id="Wu Sangui">
      <data key="d0">Wu Sangui</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A Ming general who opened the strategic pass at Shanhaiguan in 1644 to allow Manchu forces to suppress a rebellion, inadvertently enabling the establishment of the Qing Dynasty.&lt;SEP&gt;Wu Sangui was a Ming general who opened the Shanhaiguan pass in 1644 to allow Manchu forces to suppress a rebellion.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-9e1a5454aaa124cfdf6e732f09b9423f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e1a5454aaa124cfdf6e732f09b9423f-chunk-002</data>
