      <data key="d0">Qing Dynasty</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The dynasty established by the Manchu forces after they were allowed through the Great Wall in 1644, marking the end of the Ming Dynasty's rule.&lt;SEP&gt;The Qing Dynasty was established by the Manchu forces after they passed through the Shanhaiguan pass in 1644.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-9e1a5454aaa124cfdf6e732f09b9423f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e1a5454aaa124cfdf6e732f09b9423f-chunk-002</data>
