      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A strategic pass in the Great Wall opened by Wu Sangui in 1644 to allow Manchu forces to enter.&lt;SEP&gt;Shanhaiguan is the strategic pass of the Great Wall that was opened by the Ming general Wu Sangui in 1644.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-9e1a5454aaa124cfdf6e732f09b9423f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e1a5454aaa124cfdf6e732f09b9423f-chunk-002</data>
