      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The leader of a rebellion in 1644 whom the Manchu forces helped suppress after passing through the Great Wall.&lt;SEP&gt;Li Zicheng led a rebellion that prompted Wu Sangui to open the Shanhaiguan pass to Manchu forces.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-9e1a5454aaa124cfdf6e732f09b9423f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e1a5454aaa124cfdf6e732f09b9423f-chunk-002</data>
